owed by Kharkiv, Odesa, and Dnipro. The official language is Ukrainian. Ukraine covers about 600,000 km2 (230,000 sq mi), with around 32 million people.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukraine","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"UA"}],"arc":{"reports":56,"first_seen":"2026-10-12T10:33:47Z","first_title":"Russian Diesel Deal, Opposition to Trump Grows After Ceasefire Announcement","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQUW1kSnY3dktQMmFFMEF1WUlZVWw3NEwyVG1HRUxCUFJrdnozbU54dl9vQ3RzLTJfamFLeWxfZzVyRVlNanhmYVJsSmE3Sl92R2psOExFVDFteXZaNElacmhyb0N2dkdlRXNHQkhIQTdWLVhIenk3Q2VxYklQWGVvdU1OUm5yanNfY3poUloySks2QWl6bXZRZXhYZjBGWGNOOXpadVlRcW1vNTNPWWRnNFRudV82T2RYQTFVVmZRdw?oc=5","first_publisher":"La Voce di New York","earlier":[{"id":"e_0e50fbe8cec0","title":"Hundreds evacuated from Russian-occupied front-line city","date":"2026-10-30T21:03:39Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOQU9pbkJFSVRNVVRTcGUtLUdyUDByV3VYb1dQVDMtU2hMX19OblY0MGhLMmZONUNFcXJkN0dEMGljTW1YS21sV19VY0d4aVl5M1paT3VENnFsYzhiMmw5anJPNXFja3dWRGN6M3BnMGtUZFpsTzZWTEt3VF9ib0FzMmZZc3g1U2NDNHROVXZ1U2RPZUx4NWxHVjF1MnZnQjF1RWc3eGJCeE5lakszamJad2Y2ODBNbEhELTFJczZxR3U?oc=5","publisher":"Washington Examiner","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_c228eecafd71","title":"Hundreds evacuated from Melania-brokered ceasefire town of Oleshky","date":"2026-10-31T02:44:38Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE9uQmdWSE41cXoyU3hiSF91WXBiaU1BUnNHc2c2c3ZzMUhnX19BRm9FNGRnUXhXcVl0ZXJpT1BxcHNPMXB6UmJjQm0xX3ZDS2htdkR4eGF5WXRWRnYyLTRyN1R0T0lqVWfSAVxBVV95cUxOLXhDVm83NlF3VUU3VmowM1V4Y1V6czdSemltWTl3WmZqSGRnLTh5YTdxRG5hYW1nU1hLc1Y1aUF0N1E0TndQN1Z6ZkxjQURXN0FadG40aHg2LVNiTQ?oc=5","publisher":"Modern Ghana","verification":"multi_source_reporting"},{"id":"e_685a338b9687","title":"Moscow: ‘Kyiv has violated the ceasefire in Oleshky, attacking a civilian vehicle’","date":"2026-10-31T07:34:05Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiww